:\" ... Ryan Reynolds Jokes About Justin Baldoni Lawsuit, Blake Lively Reacts\\ndate: 2025-02-17\\n---\\nSNL 50: Ryan Reynolds Jokes About Justin Baldoni Lawsuit, Blake Lively Reacts\\n\\nDeadpool & Wolverine's Ryan Reynolds and his wife, Gossip Girl actress Blake Lively, were two of the celebrities that attended SNL50: The ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/snl-50-ryan-reynolds-jokes-115820675.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d71\"},\"ref\":\"d71\",\"snippet\":\" ... The 5 biggest allegations from Blake Lively's complaint against Justin Baldoni\\ndate: 2024-12-24\\n---\\nThe 5 biggest allegations from Blake Lively's complaint against Justin Baldoni\\n\\nThe \\\"It Ends With Us\\\" star Blake Lively has sued Justin Baldoni, her costar and the film's director.\\n\\nLively ... \",\"title\":\"https://news.yahoo.com/entertainment/5-biggest-revelations-blake-livelys-225247388.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"42188fd20cd849c0b6ee242aedce43949b57be99037a7a45fb78cbf1a66f6353\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"d952d9881a149382e6dc3831868779ba4008c535dc3fa6f67570701b6d4388e0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Justin Baldoni height\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_95297995746c4086becf2777"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... she and her siblings were raised by their mother and spent much of her time at the farm belonging to her grandparents. In her late teens, she moved to Melbourne, Victoria, Australia to pursue an acting career.\\n\\nFrom 2008-2010, Robbie played the character of Donna Freedman in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_date=1990-01-01,1990-12-31&gender=female\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... she and her siblings were raised by their mother and spent much of her time at the farm belonging to her grandparents. In her late teens, she moved to Melbourne, Victoria, Australia to pursue an acting career.\\n\\nFrom 2008-2010, Robbie played the character of Donna Freedman in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1990\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d72\"},\"ref\":\"d72\",\"snippet\":\" ... The telenovelas A Calzón Quitado (English title: \\\"The Naked Truth\\\") and Cosita rica (\\\"Wonderful Thing\\\") indirectly portrays (in a satirical way) the Ex Venezuelan President Hugo Chávez, with the characters of \\\"Pedro Elías Ferrer\\\" and \\\"Olegario Pérez\\\", both played by the actor Carlos Cruz.\\n\\nBesides these, another category ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telenovela\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Four years later, FX's <\\\\/span>Pose <\\\\/span><\\\\/i>left that show in the dust by debuting with a cast filled with trans actors \\\\u2014 including Mj Rodriguez, Dominique Jackson, and Indya Moore \\\\u2014 playing trans characters to tell a story about the ball scene in Eighties New ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-lists/50-best-tv-shows-of-decade-2010s-914737/\"},{\"kind