horror movies directed by Krasinski, and starring the pair as a married couple in a post-alien invasion version of Earth. Both actors also had roles in IF, another (more family friendly) film by Krasinski, although Blunt simply voiced a character instead of appearing ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/real-life-actor-couples-multiple-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d116\"},\"ref\":\"d116\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1991, Pesci earned an Oscar for Best Supporting Actor for his portrayal of real-life gangster Tommy DeVito in Goodfellas and two additional nominations in the same category for Raging Bull (1980) and The Irishman. Apart from acting, Pesci has dappled in music, having released three studio ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d117\"},\"ref\":\"d117\",\"snippet\":\" ... as Abby Winbury\\n\\nAbout the Character\\n\\nSister-in-law to the groom. Abby's married to Thomas. The couple are about to welcome their first child together.\\n\\nFanning had previously worked with Bier on The First Lady, playing Susan Elizabeth Ford. The actor and director became quite close ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/the-perfect-couple-cast-guide\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d118\"},\"ref\":\"d118\",\"snippet\":\" ... he's off to bed with the married character played by Michelle Pfeiffer. Life imitated art, as Malkovich and Pfeiffer had a real-life affair that sabotaged his marriage to actress Glenne Headly.\\n\\n\\\"Planet of the Apes\\\"\\n\\nYear released: 2001\\n\\nCouple that split: Helena Bonham Carter & Kenne